OL,3,GNEWSAMy 'surreal' new job in the chapel
OL,4,Awhere Henry VIII worshipped
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I didn't really think I would stand
OL,7,Fmuch of a chance. But I think God had
OL,8,Fother plans."
OL,10,FArchdeacon Robert Miller never dreamed
OL,11,Fhe would one day be taking up a
OL,12,Fposition which is so deeply intertwined
OL,13,Fwith the history of the Anglican
OL,14,FChurch.
OL,16,FIn a matter of weeks he will become
OL,17,Fchaplain of the Chapel Royal at Hampton
OL,18,FCourt Palace, once home to Henry VIII.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
