OL,3,GNEWSAMy 'surreal' new job in the chapel
OL,4,Awhere Henry VIII worshipped
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Londonderry's best known
OL,7,Fclergymen he will be the first cleric
OL,8,Ffrom the island of Ireland to hold the
OL,9,Fposition.
